        "airDate": "2026-09-10",
        "episodeCount": 8,
        "overview": "Season 5 is based on Kutscher’s novel \"The March Fallen\". It's set during the last days of the German republic, running from February 1933, just after Adolf Hitler was appointed Reich Chancellor of Germany, through March 5, when a violent campaign against his political opponents secured his absolute power through elections.",
