            "overview": "In Canada, Mae tries rehab and reconnects with someone from their past. Meanwhile, a despondent George searches for a purpose in her life without Mae.",
            "stillPath": "/kgwW9wYbdu4qbjIiKNnXwiMYd2m.jpg"
