            "airDate": "2010-08-09",
            "runtime": 43,
            "overview": "The eldest brother in a Boston “Brahmin” family (direct descendents of passengers on the Mayflower) is found in the harbor dead after an apparent sailing accident. But Maura’s close connection with the family and Jane’s resentment over the wealth they display threaten to derail their investigation. Angela, meanwhile, tries her hand at selling a Polynesian health drink.",
            "stillPath": "/tQTJJei3hpkyNdwzNghnvsBJGAn.jpg"
