        "airDate": "2023-07-23",
        "episodeCount": 8,
        "overview": "Joe attempts to balance her personal and professional life as the tip of the CIA's spear in the war on terror; the Lioness Program enlists Cruz to operate undercover alongside Joe among the power brokers of State terrorism.",
