            "airDate": "2010-07-13",
            "runtime": 44,
            "overview": "A super-powered vigilante is at large in Detroit, and the agents try to track down the person responsible. Meanwhile, things between Leena and Claudia are still tense, and Artie is haunted by the spirit of his dead friend.",
