            "overview": "Pete's former girlfriend Kelly Hernandez asks him to help her find her missing grandmother, and the trail leads into a cancelled telenovela. Meanwhile, Artie forces Claudia to go with Steve to investigate the case of a college student of whose spine broke in the middle of a classroom presentation.",
