            "airDate": "2016-08-29",
            "runtime": 42,
            "overview": "Jane and Maura work to solve two murders -- one from the past and one present day -- that have deep personal connections for Korsak. Jane gets a surprise visit that might lead to romance, and Maura gets upsetting feedback on her novel.",
