            "airDate": "2016-09-05",
            "runtime": 42,
            "overview": "The facts don't add up when a dead man is found handcuffed in his home. As the Bon Voyage party approaches, everyone makes a video to say goodbye. In the series finale, everyone says farewell and plans for their next adventure.",
