            "airDate": "2017-03-12",
            "runtime": 52,
            "overview": "Lucca defends a TV writer-producer in a copyright infringement case with ties to the President of the United States. Meanwhile, Mike Kresteva takes aim at Reddick, Boseman &amp; Kolstad.",
