            "runtime": 46,
            "overview": "Mike Kresteva takes his case against Reddick, Boseman &amp; Kolstad to a grand jury, but the firm devises a grand jury strategy of their own to hamper Kresteva's efforts. Colin finds himself in an awkward position in court.",
