            "overview": "Reddick, Boseman and Lockhart is left in disarray after a partner at the firm becomes the latest \"Kill All Lawyers\" victim by an unknown assailant. The Chicago police chief causes a stir when he goes after the firm's high profile clients Lemond Bishop and Colin Sweeney as potential suspects. Amidst the chaos, Colin is reminded of his true feelings for Lucca.",
