            "overview": "The FBI question Diane as part of a job background check on Kurt, leading to unexpected and serious consequences. The mayor of Chicago invites Adrian and Julius to join a 'think tank' tasked with figuring out how to spend funds that will address the \"Kill All Lawyers\" problem. Chaos ensues in the delivery room after Lucca goes into labor early.",
