            "episodeNumber": 1,
            "name": "Do You Know How to Dispose of a Body?",
            "airDate": "2019-04-07",
            "runtime": 42,
            "overview": "Eve is reeling from her act of violence against Villanelle and doesn't know whether she is alive or dead. A paranoid and severely injured Villanelle manages to get herself to the hospital for treatment. Carolyn approaches Eve with an intriguing opportunity.",
            "stillPath": "/riqVlRlQbbpfGxRXtICsl1F4GU7.jpg"
